<title>MEXICO: Industrias Martin Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Industrias Martin Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Q1 1997		     Q1 1996</p>
<p>Oper Income	  8.985 million	     6.813 million</p>
<p>Net		    7.545 million	     3.678 million</p>
<p>Revs		  63.111 million	    51.818 million</p>
<p>Integ fin cost    0.996  million	     2.79  million</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in Mexican pesos.</p>
<p>Full company name is Industrias Martin, S.A. de C.V.</p>
<p>((-- Mexico City newsroom (525) 728 9559))</p>
